## Gold-leaf ball: the gilded shader reads build/foil.tif for colour and build/foilnormal.tif for relief.
AttributeBegin
	Attribute "identifier" "name" ["gold"]
	Surface "gilded" "roughness" [0.06] "texturename" ["build/foil.tif"] "string normalname" ["build/foilnormal.tif"]
	Color [0.95 0.76 0.48]
	Translate -1.4 0 0.75
	Rotate -90 0 1 0
	Rotate -90 1 0 0
	Sphere 0.4 -0.4 0.4 360
AttributeEnd
